            |___/    live environment

 Welcome to the GrgOS live ISO.

   grgos-preview     Preview the Hyprland desktop right now (runs as root; for a
                     quick look only — the real setup happens after install).

   grgos-install     Install GrgOS to disk. This launches archinstall (pick your
                     disk, user and password), then seeds the GrgOS provisioning
                     payload onto the new system.

 After installing and rebooting, log in and run:

   /usr/local/share/grgos/scripts/install.sh

 to pull in the AI / work / trading apps, web-app shortcuts and theming.

 Docs & source:  https://github.com/monescuteodor/GrgOS

